    "gate": {
      "text": "On organic_llama8b_cold, MS-raw's mean matched-step AUROC over t = 3, 4 (run-level labels) has a run-level cluster-bootstrap 95% CI (B = 2000, seed 0) whose lower bound is > 0.5. Low-powered: with about 10 healthy runs it passes only if the true AUROC is about 0.65 or more.",
